    "Power: USB mini-B (genuine) or USB (clones), 7-12 V on VIN, or regulated 5 V on +5V. Clones use a CH340 USB chip and may need a driver.",
    "3V3 pin on CH340 clones can deliver very little current: do not power 3.3 V modules from it, use an AMS1117-3.3.",
    "Pin column orientation (which column is on the left) depends on viewing side; match pin labels to the silkscreen. Pin pairs facing each other are D13/D12 at the USB end and VIN/TX1 at the far end."
